Z||000000||fierobaby||09-03-2001||09:54 PM||||Hey all I'm sure most of you won't like htis lesson but its really something I learned tonight and really didn't reilize untill just now... so heres the lesson<P>love is... <P>knowing that no matter what you do your heart will break with his<P>telling someone you can't give them the answer they want to hear but wish you could<P>having your heart break with his and wishing you knew how to make everything right<P>thats a lot to learn at 17 my mother said she didn't learn that till about 25. Its tough not being able to fix things... I wish I could fix... but I also learned that I truly do love someone and that I always will.<P>Corinne<P>(sorry if you thought this was something funny or car related I just really wanted to see what you guys had to say on my lessoons)<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="LETTER"> AIM: Fierobaby87<BR>http://angelfire.com/sports/sfiero </FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
