Z||000023||Ken Wittlief||09-06-2001||09:12 AM||||Whew! Thats what I thought at first - but as I read the replys I was starting to get confused.<P> the ultimate of what you have experienced is when you are married - two become as one - now you have an inkling of this - if something happens to one, it happens to both.<P> I also agree with the other thing you have expressed - Love isnt the ability to be superman or God for someone - to make everything always turn out good<P>  Love is: for better or worse - we are gonna go through everything together - you will never have to be alone.<P>  Believe me, my wife and I have gone through some terrible terrible things together - I dont think either one of us could have survived them alone.<P>  Sometimes life really sucks and you get knocked flat on your face over and over - you cant stop the suckyness, you cant keep people from getting knocked down<P> but you can be there to reach out, and lift them back up.<P>  in the end thats what counts: being there.<p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 09-06-2001).]||||reg||10
